  "instructions": [
    "1. Preheat grill to medium-high heat.",
    "2. In a large bowl, whisk together soy sauce, brown sugar, and grated ginger.",
    "3. Add sliced green onions, bell peppers, and mushrooms to the marinade and toss to coat.",
    "4. Thread sausage and marinated vegetables onto skewers.",
    "5. Brush skewers with sesame oil and season with salt and pepper.",
    "6. Grill skewers for 8-10 minutes, turning occasionally.",
    "7. Cook to an internal temperature of 160°F (71°C) for sausage.",
    "8. Serve hot and enjoy!"
